  "day_cn": "周日",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-15-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-15-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">网络梗与表情包文化 (Meme Culture &amp; Viral Slang)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Hey, did you see that fitness influencer who thought he discovered a new country, but it was just a satirical article?</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Oh man, he completely swallowed the onion. I was <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">on the fence</span> about whether it was a joke at first, but no, he was dead serious.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Exactly! It’s one thing to make a minor gaffe, but it’s entirely another to be loud and wrong in front of two million followers.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">And instead of just apologizing and <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">eating humble pie</span>, he tried to post through it like nothing happened. Now his entire brand is getting memed into oblivion.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">The comment section is a goldmine right now. Even his main sponsor caught strays because people started parodying their energy drink in the background of his video.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Well, other creators know that drama sells, so they often farm for engagement by piling on. But honestly, that guy always tries to give off main character energy in every single video, so I don&#x27;t feel too sympathetic.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Yeah, that original unedited clip of him explaining geography will live rent-free in my head for a very long time. The edits are absolutely brilliant.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Enjoy it while it lasts. You know how the internet cycle works. Brands and copycats will milk a meme dry in about 48 hours, and then it’ll be old news.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">True. I was feeling a bit <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">under the weather</span> last night, couldn&#x27;t sleep, and managed to spiral into a doomscrolling vortex just looking at all the crossover parodies until 3 AM.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Just make sure you step away from the screen this weekend!</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：嘿，你看到那个健身网红了吗？他以为自己发现了一个新国家，但那其实只是一篇讽刺文章。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Hey, did you see that fitness influencer who thought he discovered a new country, but it was just a satirical article?）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：天哪，他完全把洋葱新闻当真了（误信了讽刺文章）。我一开始还在犹豫这到底是不是个笑话，但他真的是一本正经的。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Oh man, he completely swallowed the onion. I was on the fence about whether it was a joke at first, but no, he was dead serious.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：就是说啊！犯个小错是一回事，但在两百万粉丝面前理直气壮地胡说八道完全是另一回事。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Exactly! It’s one thing to make a minor gaffe, but it’s entirely another to be loud and wrong in front of two million followers.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：而且他不仅没有道歉并低头认错，反而试图若无其事地继续发帖硬撑。现在他的整个品牌都快被全网做成表情包嘲讽到渣都不剩了。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（And instead of just apologizing and eating humble pie, he tried to post through it like nothing happened. Now his entire brand is getting memed into oblivion.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：现在的评论区简直是个宝藏。甚至连他的主要赞助商都无辜躺枪了，因为大家开始恶搞他视频背景里的那款能量饮料。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（The comment section is a goldmine right now. Even his main sponsor caught strays because people started parodying their energy drink in the background of his video.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：哎，其他创作者知道八卦有流量，所以他们经常通过群嘲来刷互动量骗赞。不过说实话，那家伙在每个视频里总是试图营造出一种唯我独尊的主角光环，所以我一点也不同情他。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Well, other creators know that drama sells, so they often farm for engagement by piling on. But honestly, that guy always tries to give off main character energy in every single video, so I don&#x27;t feel too sympathetic.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：是啊，他解释地理的那个未剪辑原版视频会在我脑海里魔音绕梁很久。网友的剪辑简直太有才了。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Yeah, that original unedited clip of him explaining geography will live rent-free in my head for a very long time. The edits are absolutely brilliant.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：趁现在还能笑就多笑会儿吧。你知道互联网周期是怎么运作的。品牌和跟风者大概48小时内就会把一个梗榨干，然后这就成了旧闻。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Enjoy it while it lasts. You know how the internet cycle works. Brands and copycats will milk a meme dry in about 48 hours, and then it’ll be old news.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">A：确实。我昨晚觉得有点不舒服，睡不着，结果就陷入了无底洞般的消极刷屏，一直看到凌晨3点，全是那些跨界恶搞视频。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（True. I was feeling a bit under the weather last night, couldn&#x27;t sleep, and managed to spiral into a doomscrolling vortex just looking at all the crossover parodies until 3 AM.）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">B：这个周末你可一定要记得远离屏幕！</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#333;font-size:14px\">（Just make sure you step away from the screen this weekend!）</p>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">swallow the onion</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 误信讽刺文章或搞笑新闻（源自著名讽刺新闻网站The Onion，指没看出反串而当真）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 当某人对明显是恶搞或讽刺的内容信以为真并发表严肃评论时使用。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">be loud and wrong</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 理直气壮地胡说八道；极其自信但完全错误</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/AAVE/网络通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容在网上固执己见、声音很大但实际上毫无常识或事实根据的人。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">post through it</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在遭遇网络危机或群嘲时，不回应或不道歉，而是假装无事发生继续发毫无关联的帖子硬撑</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/网络通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 用于描述公关灾难发生时，当事人试图用疯狂发帖来掩盖尴尬的典型互联网行为。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">get memed into oblivion</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 被全网做成表情包嘲讽到身败名裂/彻底被毁</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 描述某人或某品牌因为一个愚蠢的错误，被海量网民用meme（梗图）狂欢式地嘲弄，导致名誉扫地。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">catch strays</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 无辜躺枪；在别人的争论或风波中受到波及和附带伤害</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国/AAVE/网络通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 原本焦点不在某人/某品牌身上，但在网友嘲讽主角时，顺带被拉出来嘲笑或批评。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">farm for engagement</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 刷互动量；为了骗赞、骗回复而故意制造话题或跟风（Engagement farming）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 指博主或账号发布争议性或极度跟风的内容，目的仅仅是为了操纵算法、获取点击和评论。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">give off main character energy</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 散发出主角光环/主角气场；表现得像是世界围绕自己转</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 Gen Z/全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容某人在公共场合或网络视频中表现得极度自我中心、充满戏剧性，仿佛自己是电影主角。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">live rent-free in one&#x27;s head</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在脑海里挥之不去；魔音绕梁（且不用付房租）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容某个搞笑视频、奇怪的旋律或尴尬的记忆让你无法停止回想，完全占据了你的思绪。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">milk a meme dry</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 把一个梗榨干；过度使用某个网络笑话直到它变得无聊透顶</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 批评企业品牌或网民跟风过度，把一个原本好笑的表情包或梗反复滥用，导致其迅速过气。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\">spiral into a doomscrolling vortex</strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 陷入无底洞般的消极刷屏；无法自拔地疯狂往下划手机看负面或上瘾内容</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用网络用语</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容深夜或无聊时无法控制自己，强迫性地持续浏览社交媒体信息流的状态。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Platformed bilingual practice and intercultural participation</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Post-Comment Uptake and Digital Bilingual Ease</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">social media bilingual practice intercultural participation platform discourse uptake linguistic capital</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">这是从身份协商主线向数字平台与跨文化参与延伸的次级新方向。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找平台位置、互动承接、语言资本与跨文化经验如何被共同分析的文章。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3374463/spacex-successfully-carries-out-first-ever-spaceship-catch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX首次成功实现飞船空中捕获</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX successfully carries out first-ever spaceship catch</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">SpaceX公司星舰飞船在第四次试飞中成功着陆，并首次使用机械臂在空中捕获助推器，这一突破性进展预示着未来可重复利用火箭技术将走向成熟，大幅降低太空探索成本。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/15/2003867754\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国公司推介在轨威胁探测技术</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US firms tout orbital threat detection</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">多家美国企业正积极展示其先进的在轨空间碎片及潜在威胁探测技术，旨在提升美国在日益拥挤和军事化的太空环境中的态势感知能力和国家安全防护水平。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/12/chinas-carbon-dioxide-emissions-have-begun-to-fall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国二氧化碳排放量已开始下降</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s carbon-dioxide emissions have begun to fall</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">最新数据显示，中国作为全球最大的碳排放国，其二氧化碳排放量已出现下降趋势，这表明中国在推动能源结构转型和应对气候变化方面取得初步成效，对全球减排具有积极意义。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/14/nx-s1-6041119/us-measles-elimination-status-vaccines-cdc-paho\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">全球卫生机构称美国已失去麻疹清除地位</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US has lost measles elimination status, global health authorities say</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">全球卫生权威机构宣布，由于麻疹病例激增，美国已不再被认定为麻疹清除国家，这凸显了疫苗接种率下降带来的公共卫生风险，对全球疾病防控构成警示。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/national-security/2026/11/jensen-huang-chinese-intelligence-nvidia/689430/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国在人工智能战争中的情报攻势</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s Intelligence Coup in the AI War</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有分析指出，中国正在人工智能（AI）领域展开一场情报攻势，旨在通过技术获取和人才招募，加速其AI军事和经济发展，对美国在AI领域的领先地位构成战略挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/13/realism-hans-morgenthau-david-sacks-the-realist-review-international-relations-theory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">现实主义源于创伤</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Realism Was Forged in Trauma</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这篇文章探讨了现实主义思想流派的起源及其发展，认为历史上的重大创伤和冲突事件是塑造现实主义理论，尤其是国际关系现实主义理论形成与演进的关键驱动因素。（批判性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/14/faa-ground-stop-outage-update\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;