-weather-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">窒息的野火、致命的热浪和毁灭性的洪水：2026年的极端天气预警</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Choking fires, deadly heat and devastating floods: 2026 in extreme weather</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项气候报告展望了2026年全球可能面临的极端天气事件，包括日益频发的野火、致死热浪和破坏性洪水，警示人类社会需为气候变化带来的严峻挑战做好准备。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">尼日利亚即将举行的大选受人工智能虚假信息影响</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Nigeria&#x27;s upcoming election marred by rising AI disinformation</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着尼日利亚大选临近，人工智能生成的虚假信息日益泛滥，对选举的公正性和选民的判断力构成威胁，凸显了新兴技术在政治领域的双刃剑效应。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/spacex-starship-set-for-return-to-earth-after-failed-booster-catch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX“星舰”完成首次轨道返回后的空中捕获</a><div sty