nawa for alleged drunk driving</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名驻日美军空军上尉因涉嫌酒后驾车，在日本冲绳县被当地警方逮捕。此事件再次引发了对驻日美军纪律问题的关注，可能影响美日关系及当地居民情绪。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-15/spacex-rocket-returns-to-launch-pad-after-orbitting-earth/107387168\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX火箭完成轨道飞行后首次返回发射台，创世界先例</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX rocket orbits Earth then returns to launch pad in a world-first</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">SpaceX公司的一枚火箭在完成地球轨道飞行任务后，成功返回并降落在发射台，实现了该类型任务的世界首次。这一突破标志着可重复使用火箭技术迈向成熟，有望大幅降低太空探索成本。（科技报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/spacexs-starship-returns-from-orbit-and-is-captured-by-launch-pad-arms-in-a-dramatic-first/article71703046.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX星舰从轨道返回并由发射台机械臂成功捕获，实现历史性突破</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">SpaceX’s Starship returns from orbit and is captured by launch pad arms in a dramatic first</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">SpaceX的“星舰”飞船在一次戏剧性的飞行任务中，成功从轨道返回，并首次由发射台的机械臂精确捕获。这一关键技术突破，是实现完全可重复使用太空运输系统的里程碑，预示着未来太空旅行和深空探索的新纪元。（科技报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/political/2605865/cyber-protection-of-critical-infrastructure-is-priority-work-but-taking-at-least-a-year\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">关键基础设施网络防护被列为“优先工作”，预计至少耗时一年</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Cyber protection of critical infrastructure is &#x27;priority work&#x27; but taking at least a year</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">网络安全专家指出，保护关键基础设施免受网络攻击是当前一项“优先工作”，但预计整个防护体系的建设和完善至少需要一年的时间。这表明各国政府和企业正加大对网络安全的投入，以应对日益复杂的网络威胁。（行业分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/nz-news/361059490/where-saturdays-winning-lotto-tickets-were-sold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">上周六乐透中奖彩票销售地点揭晓</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height